    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm disappearing. i haven't slept more than two hours a night in weeks because of the meds and the constant monitoring, and i just... i look at the clock and realize i have to do it all over again tomorrow. it never ends. it's just this endless loop of exhaustion and i don't even know who i am anymore. i'm just a ghost in this house.",
