      "content": "I want you to know that there are people who will fight alongside you, who will help you find a way out of this hole. Talking to a professional doesn't mean they'll magically fix everything, but they can offer you support, coping strategies, and guidance to help you navigate these feelings. It's not about finding a logical endpoint to fight, but about finding ways to manage the exhaustion and emotions so you can slowly start to move forward.",
